# Contracts (Goat OS)

Read **`contracts/AGENTS.md`** and `context/execution/next-contracts.md` before
changing schemas or generated clients.

## Non-negotiables

- One source per contract family; regenerate Go/TS clients — never hand-duplicate DTOs.
- Backend-owned UI presentation (nav, page copy, table/filter semantics) belongs
  in the app API contract (`contracts/openapi/app-api.yaml`) and bootstrap compile path.
- Version events, forms, and submissions explicitly; no mega universal Goat schema.

## After contract edits

Regenerate clients and run the narrowest check for touched surfaces (OpenAPI diff,
generated client check, affected module tests).
